FLTK mixer and control utilities for audio devices supported by the
BASound kernel drivers.

The tools talk to the device through the character devices exported by
the basound kernel modules, so the matching module must be loaded.

  bsm_hdsp      RME Hammerfall DSP matrix mixer, levels, and clock control
  bsm_digi00x   Digidesign Digi 002/003 mixer and monitoring control
  bsm_line6     Line6 POD/TonePort controls and level meters
  bsm_pf2626    M-Audio ProFire 2626 mixer, routing, and level meters

The tools are GUI applications built with FLTK.
